FILE     fbspec2.nc (from line 1)
DIALECT  series a 0 6 10 15 16 0i 30i (nothing series-specific used)
L2     CALL   G65 O9200 #1=1. #4=2. #5=3. #6=4. #7=5. #8=6. #9=7. #10=8.
L5     NC     G21 G0 X2. Y5. Z8.
L6     RET
L3     NC     M30
END    M30
NOTE     -w FILE writes the DX32 program (features/FB2DX.md)
RESULT   ok
